1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:02,390
Kolam limbah ini ditiup udara

2
00:00:02,390 --> 00:00:04,010
dua puluh empat jam bukan

3
00:00:04,010 --> 00:00:04,683
buat dingin,

4
00:00:04,683 --> 00:00:07,251
tapi memberi napas triliunan bakteri!

5
00:00:07,774 --> 00:00:10,203
Dari atas permukaannya tampak menggelegak

6
00:00:10,203 --> 00:00:11,222
seperti mendidih.

7
00:00:11,746 --> 00:00:13,493
Piringan diffuser di dasar kolam

8
00:00:13,493 --> 00:00:15,288
menyemburkan gelembung halus agar

9
00:00:15,288 --> 00:00:17,253
oksigen larut merata bagi bakteri

10
00:00:17,253 --> 00:00:17,568
aerob.

11
00:00:18,047 --> 00:00:18,871
Dengan oksigen,

12
00:00:18,871 --> 00:00:20,943
bakteri memakan limbah organik lalu

13
00:00:20,943 --> 00:00:22,517
menggumpal jadi flok berat yang

14
00:00:22,517 --> 00:00:24,389
mengendap hingga air atasnya jernih.

15
00:00:24,770 --> 00:00:26,563
Sebagian instalasi lain mengolah

16
00:00:26,563 --> 00:00:28,553
limbah secara anaerob tanpa udara.

17
00:00:28,950 --> 00:00:30,746
Oh, jadi tiupan gelembung itu

18
00:00:30,746 --> 00:00:33,244
adalah oksigen supaya bakteri sanggup

19
00:00:33,244 --> 00:00:34,620
menjernihkan air limbah.

20
00:00:35,134 --> 00:00:37,061
Nyangka nggak penjernih limbah kota

21
00:00:37,061 --> 00:00:38,227
itu mikroba lapar?

22
00:00:38,227 --> 00:00:38,743
Komen ya,

23
00:00:38,743 --> 00:00:40,181
dan tekan tombol putih di

24
00:00:40,181 --> 00:00:41,809
bawah agar dapat hal-hal yang

25
00:00:41,809 --> 00:00:42,596
nggak disangka!

